   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "From the row x = 0: \\( f(0) = 5 \\), \\( f'(0) = -4 \\), \\( g(0) = -2 \\) and \\( g'(0) = 1 \\).",
         "rule_named": "read the table"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the quotient rule, \\( h'(x) = \\frac{f'(x)\\,g(x) - f(x)\\,g'(x)}{\\left(g(x)\\right)^{2}} \\).",
         "rule_named": "quotient rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So \\( h'(0) = \\frac{\\left(-4\\right) \\cdot \\left(-2\\right) - 5 \\cdot 1}{\\left(-2\\right)^{2}} = \\frac{3}{4} \\).",
